<title>THAILAND: IMF in Thailand advising post-baht float steps.</title>
<headline>IMF in Thailand advising post-baht float steps.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Thailand said on Wednesday that International Monetary Fund (IMF) officials were in Thailand providing advice to the central bank on new monetary policy measures after the baht flotation.</p>
<p>&quot;IMF is briefing the bank on the implementation of the short-term monetary policies after the adoption of new floating foreign exchange system,&quot; deputy central bank governor Chaiyawat Wibulsawasdi told reporters.</p>
</text>
